{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>If the thief be found breaking in.</b> The expression במחתרת means he tunneled in the dark of houses. <b>He has no blood.</b> There is no liability of bloodshed for one who kills him, for it is certain that since he enters at night on account of lives he has come — that if the master of the house rises against him to save his property, he will kill the master of the house."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:02:47.257510935Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}